{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$W$", "MATH_0003": "$f : W \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-properties-covering-imply-diagonal}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7206987032ae0f5138bcef7999f60d6c17ad747ebbc3a42f70dd30b2a7876cbf", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a46acea295ba0ac0af8bd380b74aca1c10b4dd5fa3f59aaf1dac82ebbaab69f3", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space, and let <MATH_0003>\nbe a surjective, flat, locally finitely presented morphism.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0004> is unramified (i.e., <ACCENT_0001>tale, i.e., <MATH_0005>\nis Deligne-Mumford), then <MATH_0006> is DM.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0007> is locally quasi-finite, then <MATH_0008> is quasi-DM.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6bfb6ebb10dc83998a0b75773d8bb5500bbd621479092ec82ce71a3099f01d7b", "unit_id": "tag:06MB:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Delta_\\mathcal{X} : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$W \\times W \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$$\nW \\times_{\\mathcal{X} \\times \\mathcal{X}, \\Delta_\\mathcal{X}} \\mathcal{X}\n=\nW \\times_\\mathcal{X} W\n\\longrightarrow\nW \\times W\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$\\text{pr}_i : W \\times_\\mathcal{X} W \\to W$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-unramified-flat-lfp-etale}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-check-property-covering}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-permanence-unramified}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-permanence-quasi-finite}", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ ", "SPACE_0003": "\\ ", "SPACE_0004": "\\ ", "SPACE_0005": "\\ ", "SPACE_0006": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6f8e31d1d0d1e28f256416628f1344b0f27a2965ca8a324dfbbaf117051be213", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a268bd01902af0633c760e4d777d1f29f9dc3c69dd826a172e177a4b421c2010", "source_text": "Note that if <MATH_0001> is unramified, then it is <ACCENT_0001>tale by\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0001>.\nThis explains the parenthetical remark in (1).\nAssume <MATH_0002> is unramified (resp.<SPACE_0001>locally quasi-finite). We have to show that\n<MATH_0003>\nis unramified (resp.<SPACE_0002>locally quasi-finite). Note that\n<MATH_0004> is also\nsurjective, flat, and locally of finite presentation. Hence it suffices to\nshow that\n<MATH_0005>\nis unramified (resp.<SPACE_0003>locally quasi-finite), see\nProperties of Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0002>.\nBy assumption the morphism <MATH_0006>\nis unramified (resp.<SPACE_0004>locally quasi-finite). Hence\nthe displayed arrow is unramified (resp.<SPACE_0005>locally quasi-finite) by\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0003>\n(resp.<SPACE_0006>Morphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0004>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2fcfcae1286f91a0ec3aba31146551a1185288e623436bb0ca8cb81058fbcfd2", "unit_id": "tag:06MB:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-monomorphism-separated}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:27cc45beeb5ef2bcc1b2101a5f6e5c0f7d90996bff7a19c8316e54d8d233ad4b", "source_text": "A monomorphism of algebraic stacks is separated and DM.\nThe same is true for immersions of algebraic stacks.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d7833938869b272c98620e5deae099670410674c2cdd7847f4039893b9f91b0f", "unit_id": "tag:06MY:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Delta_f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-monomorphism}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-immersion-monomorphism}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5d15de12123f1424f32bcc6c8f07f15cb7775624cdf6c3d8a357eb3deccd93ce", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:edb032eb36585b842ab1e8a1a92c254d02c0ee999c9104a94f0b5422496ebb2a", "source_text": "If <MATH_0001> is a monomorphism of algebraic stacks,\nthen <MATH_0002> is an isomorphism, see\nProperties of Stacks, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nSince an isomorphism of algebraic spaces is proper and unramified we\nsee that <MATH_0003> is separated and DM. The second assertion follows from the\nfirst as an immersion is a monomorphism, see\nProperties of Stacks,\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:74f1a340d5c85db35e22bb4c540f8c6db18b85ca1021aeac4aff303da7d92c39", "unit_id": "tag:06MY:proof"}
